 "description": "<p>Patent leather catches light like nothing else in a costume wardrobe, and this dark set uses it across four pieces: a top, sleeves, a pleated skirt, and leather socks. The finish is uniform, so the outfit reads as one design rather than four purchases.</p>\n<p>The pleated skirt carries the silhouette - stiff enough to hold its shape, short enough to keep the look in costume territory. Sleeves and socks extend the shine to the extremities, which is what separates a full set from a skirt-and-top combo.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: patent leather</li>\n<li>Includes: top, sleeves, leather skirt, leather socks</li>\n<li>Style: dark, four-piece set</li>\n<li>Color: black</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Wipe-clean by nature, which is the quiet advantage of patent leather over fabric costumes. Fits 40-60 kg best.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Four-piece dark patent leather set with top, sleeves, pleated skirt and leather socks, one size for 40-60 kg.</p>\n",
